# Agon 09_sand_testtubepuzzle_dark layer 4: SetPatrolDest's HasPatrolPath-true arm. The disc scan
# (CPatterned::HasPatrolPath is a kSS_Patrol/kSM_Follow connection) finds the metroid placements
# with a patrol path here (and in 09_sand_testtubepuzzle L3/L5) and none in the casual pirates
# area, so the false arm is the run there and this is the true one: codecall reaches the code
# function the shipped FSM never asks for.
@f300 layer 4
@f400 layer 1
@f560 god 1
@f580 send u05f8 Activate; send u05ec Activate; send u05e6 Activate
@f620 objs metroid
@f700 codecall u05f8 SetPatrolDest
@f800 codecall u05ec SetPatrolDest
@f900 codecall u05e6 SetPatrolDest
@f1000 obj u05f8
@f1100 codecall u05f8 SetPatrolDest
@f1200 codecall u05ec SetPatrolDest
@f1300 codecall u05e6 SetPatrolDest
@f1400 obj u05f8
